sabre hussain karbe jawaa'n dekhta raha <br>
jalti zamee'n pa baazu barabar ka laal tha<br>
<br>
rukhsat huwe jo khaime se akber jihaad ko <br>
jaise koi janaza bhare ghar se jata ho <br>
wo bhi nazara sheh ki nigahou me rehgaya<br>
<br>
aayi sadaey aakhri jab run se laal ki <br>
rukhsat zaeef baap se binaayi hogayi <br>
har soo dhuwaa'n hussain ki ankhou me chhagaya<br>
<br>
har ek qadam pa thokare'n khaate the shaah e dee'n <br>
laashe jawaa'n dikhaayi nahi deti thi kahi'n <br>
kehte the laal phir se sunaao mujhe sada<br>
<br>
kuch soojta nahi tha shahe dee'n ko raah me <br>
maqtal ki khaak thi basi sheh ki nigaah me <br>
laashe pe koniyou se gaye shaahe karbala<br>
<br>
kehte the shaah aye ali akber utho utho <br>
ankhe'n to kholo laal mere kuch jawab do <br>
kuch haal e dil sunao to beta mujhe zara<br>
<br>
ashoor ki azaa'n abhi kanou me hai pisar <br>
kadiyal jawaan lag gayi kis ki tujhe nazar <br>
bas ek baar phir se sunao wahi sada<br>
<br>
kyu aydiyaa'n ragadte ho batlaao meri jaa'n <br>
seene pe kyu hai haath tumhe dard hai kaha'n <br>
thamja ke phal mai barchhi ka tujhse karu'n juda<br>
<br>
armaan dil me banu ke sab ghut ke rehgaye <br>
aansu lahu ke laila ki aankhou se behgaye <br>
kehti thi maa mai kis tarha jee paungi bhala<br>
<br>
beemar ek behen tera takti hai raasta <br>
waada jo tha behen se wo pura na hosaka <br>
kya de'n jawaab usko teri maa zara bata<br>
<br>
saqqa e haram tujh pe fida shaahe karbala <br>
akber sa laal tumne rahe haq me dediya <br>
nouha ye padhke pursa tumhe denge hum sada<br>
<br>
kaise sohail ab ho baya'n dard o gham bhala <br>
akber ka daagh sheh ke jigar par sada raha <br>
bete ka koi dard na bhoole shahe huda<br>
